&_nc_oc=AdrNUJl0kl7seBMl5oIqUVt9-lzCSRWDIZeS137i4bV0ST7X75GAEibHa79ytCnSn_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLj5ALJIi8ov2sHG_X1aaTJLdiNu2fJrkay4S_DwqGMhg&oe=6A998F3E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7vlAkiZwuPUQ7kNvwGBF6DK&_nc_oc=AdqXiJJMqHKEwSQEGvzDjKLft4q3WKHCmxYaoi02uYzHRc-9LKmIR02KRu6Z9qFhVtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIfRHworXMcJ4_p25sC5tFPFMjxaIrpCuO9r-PwYS1_jQ&oe=6A99A03C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0vKjRodZ3TYQ7kNvwFtxin2&_nc_oc=Adpj0wVY8pdpWc-SeHLLzjDVH04s1gqqXcjJ5TMzI9FcVK_1BLEnhzcCIOvfdJQi3yc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ3P6D9xoqwStfRHx3ZrD626PvofbIHo7wLtG7c9bDHjA&oe=6A998687"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=avrdR6ra3woQ7kNvwHnf5MD&_nc_oc=AdpHirD_MkQqmW1IJ-TJ2Z_FdkrTckQCa6FXaaFd8dJg-HaBgArP_pbuXouUikKhC9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIl4BsuFeIV72aqC969AGvXk951AB9UjsOXw9zeID4fhQ&oe=6A997255"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VFT2jONqiNwQ7kNvwHhuyCC&_nc_oc=AdroxqeJHVCVXsl5jISR5U-G4j8HsS5MepT41PO6AXnqwkUmbHuNj4nrJpD33qLFFFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6ZHDVVVkmAZ857Ehzkx6ORZBnk8qUlCxLDuN3Iu8Tag&oe=6A997EE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.